              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw iyo, (ni yo yaremewe vyose kandi ni yo ibeshejeho vyose), mu kurōngōra abana benshi ngw ibazane mu bgiza, vyari biyikwiye gutunganisha rwose indōngōzi y’agakiza kabo kubabazwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
